  "description": "Role-based authentication, URL-based permissions and a role-aware sidebar menu for ASP.NET Core (MVC, Razor Pages, Minimal APIs, Blazor Server), managed at runtime from a built-in admin panel (users, roles, permissions, menu, route discovery, operation log).",
