  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: Blazor shell components (SuperAdminLayout, SuperAdminHead, SuperAdminScripts) with the same markup as the Razor Pages layout. Bootstrap 5.3.8 (was 5.1.3) with the same look. Colour variables (--sa-accent, --sa-sidebar-bg, ...), UI:Stylesheets for app CSS on every panel page, and UI:ColorMode = Light | Dark | Auto. Breaking: the Blazor SuperAdminMenu now renders the sidebar markup; use Variant=\"SuperAdminMenuVariant.Plain\" for the 0.2 list markup. superadmin.js survives Blazor re-renders. Full list: CHANGELOG.md in the repository.",
